  "body": "a, area, and frameset elements with name=\"\" attributes do not, in fact,\ncontribute to the window's named properties. Fixes #1810.\n\n---\n\nTest revision: https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/pull/3875\n\nNo browser bugs filed since we are aligning with browser reality. (Firefox fails the revised tests because it does not return a HTMLCollection, and Chrome fails them because it does not support applet elements, but everyone passes the things this commit touches on.)\n",
